{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"container med post-content\">\n<figure class=\"img-border featured-image\">\n<img/>\n</figure>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple 本月推出了一系列全新產品，包括全新的 AirPods 5 及 Beats 360 ANC 耳機（發售折扣最後一天）、Apple Watch Series 12 及 Ultra 4，以及搭載 M6 晶片的最新 Mac mini 和 Mac Studio。所有產品均配備一系列全新配件。</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Amazon 亦透過早秋 Prime Day 優惠，為部分產品提供多項發售折扣，方便想即刻入手的用戶，我們已為你收集齊全，詳列如下。</p>\n<span id=\"more-1072147\"></span>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image alignwide size-full\"><img/></figure>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-airpods-5\">AirPods 5</h2>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>AirPods 5（配備 ANC）$129</li>\n<li>AirPods 5（配備無線充電盒）$149</li>\n</ul>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image alignwide size-full\"><img/></figure>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-beats-360\">Beats 360</h2>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">***注意：今天是 Beats 360 Cushion Kit 享有 80 折優惠的最後一天</p>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image alignwide size-full\"><img/></figure>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-apple-watch-series-12\">Apple Watch Series 12</h2>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-apple-watch-ultra-4\">Apple Watch Ultra 4</h2>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-apple-watch-se-3\">Apple Watch SE 3</h2>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image alignwide size-full\"><img/></figure>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-m6-mac-mini\">M6 Mac mini</h2>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-mac-studio\">Mac Studio</h2>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-2026-apple-watch-bands\">2026 年 Apple Watch 錶帶</h2>\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text\" style=\"grid-template-columns:20% auto\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img/></figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple Watch Alpine Loop，49mm，深橄欖色，鈦金屬原色，大 $99</p>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text\" style=\"grid-template-columns:20% auto\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img/></figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-tex